---
import App from "@/components/app.astro";
import { siteData } from "@/data/site";

const { social, referral } = siteData;
---

<App
	title="About Pinoy Techie and Referral Disclosure"
	description="Pinoy Techie makes short tech tips and tutorials for Filipinos. Here's who runs this site, how referral rewards work, and how to reach out.">
	<div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-12 md:px-6 md:py-20">
		<h1 class="font-display text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight md:text-6xl">About Pinoy Techie</h1>

		<div class="article mt-8">
			<p>
				Pinoy Techie makes short tech tips and tutorials for Filipinos. This website is where I
				put the longer, searchable version of the money-app topics people keep asking about,
				starting with MariBank.
			</p>
			<p>
				Each guide says what is verified, what changes often (like savings rates), and where to
				confirm the latest numbers in the app.
			</p>

			<h2 id="disclosure">Referral disclosure</h2>
			<p>
				This site shares the MariBank referral code <strong>{referral.code}</strong>. New users who
				sign up with it can receive {referral.bonus} after meeting MariBank's deposit conditions.
				Referral programs usually reward the person who shared the code too, so I may earn a
				reward when you sign up with it.
			</p>
			<p>
				Pinoy Techie is independent and is not affiliated with or endorsed by MariBank or Sea
				Group. MariBank sets and can change the reward terms. Nothing on this site is financial
				advice.
			</p>

			<h2>Contact</h2>
			<p>
				{
					social.email ? (
						<>Email <a href={`mailto:${social.email}`}>{social.email}</a>.</>
					) : social.youtube ? (
						<>Message me on <a href={social.youtube}>YouTube</a>.</>
					) : (
						<>Contact details are coming soon.</>
					)
				}
			</p>
		</div>
	</div>
</App>
